(Preamble) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We the People of the United States, in Order to form a more perfect Union, establish Justice, insure) Tj T*
(domestic Tranquility, provide for the common defence, promote the general Welfare, and secure the) Tj T*
(Blessings of Liberty to ourselves and our Posterity, do ordain and establish this Constitution for) Tj T*
(the United States of America.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
