(Article. VII.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Ratification of the Conventions of nine States, shall be sufficient for the Establishment of) Tj T*
(this Constitution between the States so ratifying the Same.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(done in Convention by the Unanimous Consent of the States present the Seventeenth Day of September) Tj T*
(in the Year of our Lord one thousand seven hundred and Eighty seven and of the Independance of the) Tj T*
(United States of America the Twelfth In witness whereof We have hereunto subscribed our Names,) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(G°. Washington) Tj T*
(Presidt and deputy from Virginia) Tj T*
() Tj T*
